# Extra Python packages a sandbox may `pip install` (docs/guides/sandbox.md
# "Mirror and wheelhouse"). The sandbox has no route to PyPI: `make wheelhouse`
# downloads exactly what requirements.lock names, and the mirror serves only
# that. Add a package here, recompile the lock (the
# command is in requirements.lock's header), then `make wheelhouse`. Binary
# wheels only.
# Pins that the image already carries come from image-freeze.txt (-c), so a
# package here can never replace one of the image's.

# Fast DataFrame library for data larger than pandas handles comfortably.
polars
# Embedded analytical SQL engine; queries CSV and Parquet files directly.
duckdb
# Statistical tests (ANOVA, effect sizes, post-hoc) returned as DataFrames.
pingouin
# Survival analysis (Kaplan-Meier, Cox regression).
lifelines
